<view class="container">
  <view class="balance-info">
    <text class="label">可用余额</text>
    <text class="amount">¥{{balance.available_balance.toFixed(2)}}</text>
  </view>

  <view class="withdraw-form">
    <view class="form-item">
      <text class="form-label">提现金额</text>
      <view class="input-wrapper">
        <text class="currency">¥</text>
        <input type="digit" class="amount-input" placeholder="请输入提现金额" value="{{withdrawAmount}}" bindinput="onAmountInput" />
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="quick-actions">
      <button class="all-btn" bindtap="handleWithdrawAll">全部提现</button>
    </view>

    <view class="tips">
      <text class="tip-text">今日已提现 {{todayWithdrawCount}}/10 次，单日累计上限 ¥2,000</text>
    </view>

    <view class="notice">
      <view class="notice-title">提现规则</view>
      <view class="notice-item">1. 结算周期：订单完成后，服务费将计入"总收入"，满7个工作日后自动转入“可提现余额，无需手动申请结算。</view>
      <view class="notice-item">2. 可提现余额：已结算金额，实时更新。单笔提现金额¥0.10~¥200，单日累计提现上限¥2,000。</view>
      <view class="notice-item">3. 提现次数：每日最多可提现10次（以自然日00:00重置）。</view>
      <view class="notice-item">4. 申请时间：全天 0:00-24:00 均可提交提现申请，无时段限制。</view>
      <view class="notice-item">5. 到账时效：提交后系统自动处理（无需人工审核），资金实时到账微信零钱，最长不超过2小时。</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <button class="submit-btn {{canWithdraw ? 'active' : ''}}" disabled="{{!canWithdraw || submitting}}" loading="{{submitting}}" bindtap="handleWithdraw">
    确认提现
  </button>
</view>